\section{Conclusion}
The residual mean \(3\) corrects the fixed baseline exactly on all five observations. Recorded MSE is \(9\), \(2.25\), and \(0\) at \(b=0,1.5,3\), respectively. Explicit dependencies and retained figure sources support inspection; predictive behavior on other observations remains unevaluated.
